is used only for reporting or also for entitlement/reconciliation decisions.\n\n6. **Verification policy:** request two frozen audit items:  \n   - A: reconciliation implementation and executed test results covering multi-subscription same-customer same-report-date plus API retry behavior.  \n   - B: 429/fallback handling evidence: run/API logs for page-2 retrieval, snapshot freshness metadata, output stale-disclosure fields, and code path confirming Billing API authority or blocking.  \n\nAwaiting retrieval before final action/confidence/evidence-sufficiency update.",
